                              "text" : "http://stackoverflow.com/questions/4637774/is-the-size-of-a-struct-required-to-be-an-exact-multiple-of-the-alignment-of-tha",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "\"The alignment size of a struct is the offset from one element to the next element when you have an array of that struct.\"",
